## 💡 My engineering approach

- **Business-first:** I start by understanding the workflow and domain rules.
- **Clear boundaries:** I keep responsibilities separated so the code remains understandable.
- **Secure by design:** Authentication and authorization are part of the architecture, not an afterthought.
- **Practical delivery:** I care about usable interfaces, reliable data, validation, and operational health.
- **Continuous learning:** I use projects across .NET, Flutter, Python, AI, and signal processing to keep expanding my engineering range.

